      "content": "omg that sounds so scary. i dont really want to go to the er though, it's so expensive and takes forever. plus i dont feel sick right now, just a little tired. it was only like 5 seconds. u sure it cant just be my blood pressure acting up from not drinking enough? i usually just take an extra aspirin or something when i feel off, would that help?",
